---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import QuickAnswer from '../components/QuickAnswer.astro';
import CtaSection from '../components/CtaSection.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="History of Algeria | Algeria Compass" description="From Numidia and Roman Africa through the Islamic dynasties, Ottoman regency and independence — a short history for travellers." image="/assets/img/ksar-mural-art.jpg" keywords={["history of Algeria","Numidia","Roman Algeria","Ottoman Algiers","Algerian independence"]} region="roman">
  <Hero title="History of Algeria" eyebrow="Knowledge hub" text="From Numidia and Roman Africa through the Islamic dynasties, Ottoman regency and independence — a short history for travellers." image="/assets/img/ksar-mural-art.jpg" alt="Mural depicting an ancient Algerian settlement" />
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{name:'Home',href:'/'},{name:'History of Algeria'}]} />
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
    <QuickAnswer text="Algeria's history reaches back to the Berber kingdom of Numidia and the Roman province of Africa, whose cities — Djémila, Timgad, Tipaza — are among the best preserved anywhere. Successive Islamic dynasties, the Ottoman regency of Algiers, 132 years of French colonisation and the 1954–62 war of independence shaped the modern nation." />
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Algeria's history reaches back to the Berber kingdom of Numidia and the Roman province of Africa, whose cities — Djémila, Timgad, Tipaza — are among the best preserved anywhere. Successive Islamic dynasties, the Ottoman regency of Algiers, 132 years of French colonisation and the 1954–62 war of independence shaped the modern nation.</p>
      <h2>Explore further</h2>
      <ul><li><a href="/destinations/">Roman & historic destinations</a></li><li><a href="/unesco/">UNESCO sites</a></li></ul>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <CtaSection />
</BaseLayout>
